<section class="shipping-policy-section section-padding">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <div class="shipping-header text-center">
      <span class="text-eyebrow">Customer Care &amp; Logistics</span>
      <h1 class="h2">Shipping, Delivery &amp; Exchanges</h1>
      <p class="text-body">Everything you need to know about order dispatch, Cash on Delivery, and hassle-free size exchanges.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="shipping-content-cards">
      <!-- Card 1: Delivery -->
      <div class="shipping-card">
        <h2 class="h4">🚚 Nationwide Express Delivery</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Delivery Timeline:</strong> Orders are processed within 24 hours and delivered across Pakistan in <strong>2 to 4 working days</strong>.</li>
          <li><strong>Courier Partners:</strong> Dispatched via premium express courier services with real-time tracking updates sent via SMS/WhatsApp.</li>
          <li><strong>Shipping Charges:</strong> Flat standard shipping rate, or <strong>FREE Shipping</strong> on orders above Rs. 6,000.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Cash on Delivery -->
      <div class="shipping-card">
        <h2 class="h4">💵 Cash on Delivery (COD)</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Pay at Your Doorstep:</strong> We offer Cash on Delivery across all cities, towns, and regions in Pakistan.</li>
          <li><strong>Order Confirmation:</strong> Our team will confirm your order details and delivery address via WhatsApp/call prior to dispatch.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: 7-Day Exchange Policy -->
      <div class="shipping-card">
        <h2 class="h4">🔄 7-Day Hassle-Free Exchange Policy</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Need a Different Size or Color?</strong> We gladly exchange unwashed, unworn garments with original tags within <strong>7 days</strong> of delivery.</li>
          <li><strong>How to Exchange:</strong> Simply reach out to our WhatsApp Support Team with your Order Number and desired size. We will arrange a reverse pickup / replacement dispatch for you.</li>
          <li><strong>Quality Guarantee:</strong> In the rare case of any manufacturing defect or incorrect item, we cover 100% of return shipping costs and send an immediate replacement.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .shipping-policy-section {
    padding: 60px 20px;
    background-color: var(--color-background, #fff);
  }
  .shipping-header {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .shipping-header h1 {
    margin: 8px 0 12px;
  }
  .shipping-content-cards {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .shipping-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e5e5e5);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 24px 28px;
    background: #fafafa;
  }
  .shipping-card h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }
  .shipping-card ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 20px;
  }
  .shipping-card li {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #333;
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Shipping Policy Page",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
